   <narrative xml:lang="SV">POL VA-sem i Wroclaw</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POL Water sem in Wroclaw</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen bst&#xE5;r av ett endagars-seminarium i Wroclaw, Polen, d&#xE4;r svenska l&#xF6;sningar och erfarenheter av VA-hantering redovisas med speciell tonvikt p&#xE5; EU- anpassning. Programmet &#xE4;r utarbetat av Swedish Water Development (SWD), och Vattenbolaget i Wroclaw.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One-day seminar in Wroclaw, Poland, aimed to politicians and civil servants responsible for water and sewage management in polish municipalities and county councils. It will cover the Swedish experiences and solutions regarding water management to assist the participants in their work.</narrative>
  </description>
